ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:9.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:9.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja441:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:10.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:10.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja441:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja441:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja441:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja441:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja441:15.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:15.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:15.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:15.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:15.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja441:15.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja441:16.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja441:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja441:0.2": "Dasakanipāta ", "ja441:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja441:0.4": "3. Catuposathiyajātaka ", "ja441:1.1": "“Yo kopaneyye na karoti kopaṁ, ", "ja441:1.2": "Na kujjhati sappuriso kadāci; ", "ja441:1.3": "Kuddhopi so nāvikaroti kopaṁ, ", "ja441:1.4": "Taṁ ve naraṁ samaṇamāhu loke”. ", "ja441:2.1": "“Ūnūdaro yo sahate jighacchaṁ, ", "ja441:2.2": "Danto tapassī mitapānabhojano; ", "ja441:2.3": "Āhārahetu na karoti pāpaṁ, ", "ja441:2.4": "Taṁ ve naraṁ samaṇamāhu loke”. ", "ja441:3.1": "“Khiḍḍaṁ ratiṁ vippajahitvāna sabbaṁ, ", "ja441:3.2": "Na cālikaṁ bhāsasi kiñci loke; ", "ja441:3.3": "Vibhūsaṭṭhānā virato methunasmā, ", "ja441:3.4": "Taṁ ve naraṁ samaṇamāhu loke”. ", "ja441:4.1": "“Pariggahaṁ lobhadhammañca sabbaṁ, ", "ja441:4.2": "Yo ve pariññāya pariccajeti; ", "ja441:4.3": "Dantaṁ ṭhitattaṁ amamaṁ nirāsaṁ, ", "ja441:4.4": "Taṁ ve naraṁ samaṇamāhu loke”. ", "ja441:5.1": "“Pucchāma kattāramanomapaññaṁ, ", "ja441:5.2": "Kathāsu no viggaho atthi jāto; ", "ja441:5.3": "Chindajja kaṅkhaṁ vicikicchitāni, ", "ja441:5.4": "Tadajja kaṅkhaṁ vitaremu sabbe”. ", "ja441:6.1": "“Ye paṇḍitā atthadasā bhavanti, ", "ja441:6.2": "Bhāsanti te yoniso tattha kāle; ", "ja441:6.3": "Kathaṁ nu kathānaṁ abhāsitānaṁ, ", "ja441:6.4": "Atthaṁ nayeyyuṁ kusalā janindā. ", "ja441:7.1": "Kathaṁ have bhāsati nāgarājā, ", "ja441:7.2": "Garuḷo pana venateyyo kimāha; ", "ja441:7.3": "Gandhabbarājā pana kiṁ vadesi, ", "ja441:7.4": "Kathaṁ pana kurūnaṁ rājaseṭṭho”. ", "ja441:8.1": "“Khantiṁ have bhāsati nāgarājā, ", "ja441:8.2": "Appāhāraṁ garuḷo venateyyo; ", "ja441:8.3": "Gandhabbarājā rativippahānaṁ, ", "ja441:8.4": "Akiñcanaṁ kurūnaṁ rājaseṭṭho”. ", "ja441:9.1": "“Sabbāni etāni subhāsitāni, ", "ja441:9.2": "Na hettha dubbhāsitamatthi kiñci; ", "ja441:9.3": "Yasmiñca etāni patiṭṭhitāni, ", "ja441:9.4": "Arāva nābhyā susamohitāni; ", "ja441:9.5": "Catubbhi dhammehi samaṅgibhūtaṁ, ", "ja441:9.6": "Taṁ ve naraṁ samaṇamāhu loke”. ", "ja441:10.1": "“Tuvañhi seṭṭho tvamanuttarosi, ", "ja441:10.2": "Tvaṁ dhammagū dhammavidū sumedho; ", "ja441:10.3": "Paññāya pañhaṁ samadhiggahetvā, ", "ja441:10.4": "Acchecchi dhīro vicikicchitāni; ", "ja441:10.5": "Acchecchi kaṅkhaṁ vicikicchitāni, ", "ja441:10.6": "Cundo yathā nāgadantaṁ kharena. ", "ja441:11.1": "Nīluppalābhaṁ vimalaṁ anagghaṁ, ", "ja441:11.2": "Vatthaṁ idaṁ dhūmasamānavaṇṇaṁ; ", "ja441:11.3": "Pañhassa veyyākaraṇena tuṭṭho, ", "ja441:11.4": "Dadāmi te dhammapūjāya dhīra. ", "ja441:12.1": "Suvaṇṇamālaṁ satapattaphullitaṁ, ", "ja441:12.2": "Sakesaraṁ ratnasahassamaṇḍitaṁ; ", "ja441:12.3": "Pañhassa veyyākaraṇena tuṭṭho, ", "ja441:12.4": "Dadāmi te dhammapūjāya dhīra. ", "ja441:13.1": "Maṇiṁ anagghaṁ ruciraṁ pabhassaraṁ, ", "ja441:13.2": "Kaṇṭhāvasattaṁ maṇibhūsitaṁ me; ", "ja441:13.3": "Pañhassa veyyākaraṇena tuṭṭho, ", "ja441:13.4": "Dadāmi te dhammapūjāya dhīra. ", "ja441:14.1": "Gavaṁ sahassaṁ usabhañca nāgaṁ, ", "ja441:14.2": "Ājaññayutte ca rathe dasa ime; ", "ja441:14.3": "Pañhassa veyyākaraṇena tuṭṭho, ", "ja441:14.4": "Dadāmi te gāmavarāni soḷasa”. ", "ja441:15.1": "“Sāriputto tadā nāgo, ", "ja441:15.2": "supaṇṇo pana kolito; ", "ja441:15.3": "Gandhabbarājā anuruddho, ", "ja441:15.4": "rājā ānandapaṇḍito; ", "ja441:15.5": "Vidhuro bodhisatto ca, ", "ja441:15.6": "evaṁ dhāretha jātakan”ti. ", "ja441:16.1": "Catuposathiyajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja441:0.1": "", "ja441:0.2": "", "ja441:0.3": "", "ja441:0.4": "", "ja441:1.1": "", "ja441:1.2": "", "ja441:1.3": "", "ja441:1.4": "samaṇamāhu → samaṇaṁ āhu (bj) ", "ja441:2.1": "", "ja441:2.2": "", "ja441:2.3": "", "ja441:2.4": "samaṇamāhu → samaṇaṁ āhu (mi5.3.9:1 [Aggaggasamaṇapañha]) ", "ja441:3.1": "", "ja441:3.2": "", "ja441:3.3": "", "ja441:3.4": "", "ja441:4.1": "", "ja441:4.2": "", "ja441:4.3": "", "ja441:4.4": "", "ja441:5.1": "kattāramanomapaññaṁ → … manomapañña (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja441:5.2": "", "ja441:5.3": "", "ja441:5.4": "Tadajja → tayajja (bj) ", "ja441:6.1": "", "ja441:6.2": "", "ja441:6.3": "", "ja441:6.4": "", "ja441:7.1": "", "ja441:7.2": "", "ja441:7.3": "", "ja441:7.4": "", "ja441:8.1": "", "ja441:8.2": "", "ja441:8.3": "", "ja441:8.4": "", "ja441:9.1": "", "ja441:9.2": "", "ja